1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,841
Even though I'm using frontier style equipment on this trip I've got a few modern things with me.
虽然这次旅行用的是拓荒时代风格的装备，我还是随身带了几件现代物品。

2
00:00:04,841 --> 00:00:12,000
I've got my garmin inreach mini so I can send and receive text messages and my wife can track my location it's good for safety.
我带着一台卫星通信设备，可以收发短信，妻子也能查看我的位置；作者认为这对安全有帮助。

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,560
I also have a headlamp because I need to be able to film at night.
我还带了头灯，因为晚上需要能够拍摄。

4
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:26,000
I also have about 2 or 3 lbs of gopro batteries backup cameras and gopro pr mounts in my bag.
包里还有约两三磅的运动相机电池、备用相机和支架。

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,521
This water is going to be clean but it's going to have a bit of a funny taste.
作者说，这水会干净，但味道可能有点怪。

6
00:00:29,521 --> 00:00:36,801
So I brought this it's for making tea you unscrew it you just put a little loose leaf tea in there.
所以我带了这个泡茶器。把它拧开，放一点散茶进去。

7
00:00:36,801 --> 00:00:42,041
You can harvest berries and herbs that you find along the way put it in there make tea out of it.
作者还谈到把沿途找到的浆果和草本植物放进去泡茶。

8
00:00:42,041 --> 00:00:45,680
And in this case I've got a peach lemon herbal tea in there.
这次我放的是桃子柠檬花草茶。

9
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:51,641
Those of you guys who watch my channel might recognize my mug I made this out of cow horn a couple years ago and did a video on it.
看我频道的观众可能认得这个杯子，是我几年前用牛角做的，还拍过一段视频。

10
00:00:51,641 --> 00:00:59,841
My te steeper hooked around the handle there just let that steep for about 5 minutes or so.
泡茶器勾在把手上，就让茶浸泡大约五分钟。

11
00:00:59,841 --> 00:01:07,990
Just sit that over there this is salted fatback bacon last a long time even without refrigeration.
先把它放那儿。这是盐腌肥背肉；作者说，它即使不冷藏也能放很久。

12
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:15,880
So you can carry it around in your pack makes great seasoning and stew.
他说可以把它带在背包里，用来调味和做炖汤很不错。

13
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:25,560
Put my potatoes in there throw that meat in there between the grease and all the seasoning on the fatback it's going to give a lot of flavor to this stew.
把土豆和肉放进去，肥背肉的油脂和调味会给这锅炖汤带来许多风味。

14
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:38,041
Got some carrots there all right got some bulb onions here.
这里还有胡萝卜。好，我还带了些球茎洋葱。

15
00:01:38,041 --> 00:01:48,000
Got a bundle of chives here little soups and stews like this are pretty awesome cuz pretty much anything you find that you can eat you can throw in the stew.
我带了一把细香葱。作者喜欢这种炖汤，因为他觉得找到的可食用材料几乎都能放进去。

16
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:52,081
Whether it's a squirrel or some herbs or a mushroom or whatever.
他说，不管是松鼠肉、草本植物、蘑菇还是别的什么。

17
00:01:52,081 --> 00:01:55,911
I always bring way too much food and I brought along some beef jerky.
我总是带太多吃的，还带了些牛肉干。

18
00:01:55,921 --> 00:02:03,041
And you can throw that in your stew too has lots of flavor lots of protein.
作者说，也可以把牛肉干放进炖汤，味道浓，还有蛋白质。

19
00:02:03,041 --> 00:02:11,081
All right it's coming along pretty good needs a few more minutes got some raw sugar for my tea here.
好了，进展不错，还需要几分钟。我还给茶准备了些原糖。

20
00:02:11,081 --> 00:02:16,071
I'm a little bit cold tired and thirsty and this tea just hits the spot.
我有点冷、有点累，也有点渴，这杯茶真是正合我意。

21
00:02:16,081 --> 00:02:22,670
Tastes even better when you drink it out of a cow horn mug you made yourself.
用自己做的牛角杯喝，感觉味道更好了。

22
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:25,801
While I wait for my soup to simmer I think I'm going to go get some more firewood.
等汤慢慢煨着的时候，我想再去找些柴火。

23
00:02:25,801 --> 00:02:43,880
It's going to be really cold tonight all right I like the soup it's tasting good.
今晚会很冷。好了，我喜欢这汤，尝着不错。

24
00:02:43,880 --> 00:02:49,801
Add just a little pinch of flour oh that stew smells amazing.
再加一小撮面粉。哦，这炖汤闻起来真香。

25
00:02:49,801 --> 00:02:56,041
Looks perfect can smell the chives and the onions and the bacon fat.
看起来正好，能闻到细香葱、洋葱和培根油脂的香味。

26
00:02:56,041 --> 00:03:14,721
Oh it's so hot I can see my breath but this stew is hitting the spot.
哦，真烫。天冷得能看见我呼出的白气，但这锅炖汤吃着真舒服。

27
00:03:14,721 --> 00:03:21,031
I'm just going to boil up some water and fill up my canteen and have some water ready for the morning.
我打算再烧点水，装满水壶，给明天早上备好水。

28
00:03:21,041 --> 00:03:27,120
For those of you that watch my videos you won't be surprised I brought a little bag of flour here to make some bread.
经常看我视频的人不会意外：我还带了一小袋面粉，准备用来做面包。

29
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:37,560
I'm going to be doing that in the morning so I'm going to go ahead and add my yeast and water and get it ready and so it can rise overnight.
我明早再做，所以现在就加上酵母和水，先准备好，让它发一整夜。

30
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:47,161
Going to add my sugar I'm going to add some whole wheat bread flour.
接着加糖，再加些全麦面包粉。

31
00:03:47,161 --> 00:04:01,981
My bag has a ton of holes in it right let's just let that sit and rise till morning.
袋子上有好多洞。好了，就让它静置发酵到早晨。
